WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:43.569
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:43.839 --> 00:46.304
[7 Hours 30 Minutes Before the Incident]

3
01:05.520 --> 01:07.210
Shall we go?

4
01:09.848 --> 01:12.205
We'll have a little time when we get to the location.

5
01:12.205 --> 01:13.460
Let's run it once more, then.

6
01:13.460 --> 01:15.317
You must be tired from being up all night.

7
01:15.317 --> 01:17.193
I'm fine. I'll sleep in the car.

8
01:24.501 --> 01:26.491
Lee Hyeong Won.

9
01:26.491 --> 01:28.638
I heard you're not doing the movie.

10
01:28.638 --> 01:30.644
Good call.

11
01:31.724 --> 01:33.821
You bastard, learn to say hello.

12
01:33.821 --> 01:36.877
Manners are half of...

13
01:50.737 --> 01:52.116
Hey.

14
01:54.425 --> 01:56.197
What is this?

15
01:59.638 --> 02:01.475
What the hell is this?

16
02:06.732 --> 02:08.984
I got this after winning my first judo medal.

17
02:08.984 --> 02:12.230
Some older guys at the orphanage did this...

18
02:12.230 --> 02:14.590
so I'd live a lousy life like them.

19
02:16.902 --> 02:18.201
Why?

20
02:18.201 --> 02:20.215
Want to know more?

21
02:21.121 --> 02:23.032
Oh, no.

22
02:23.032 --> 02:24.598
Sorry.

23
02:28.797 --> 02:30.944
What are you doing today?

24
02:34.238 --> 02:36.249
Just going to relax.

25
02:36.249 --> 02:38.384
You're not going out?

26
02:38.384 --> 02:40.664
Do I have to tell you that too?

27
02:54.204 --> 02:55.402
[Episode 7] All right.

28
02:55.402 --> 02:56.649
We'll load them in here.

29
02:56.649 --> 02:58.012
- But... - Yeah?

30
02:58.012 --> 03:01.192
Your car's pretty compact.

31
03:01.192 --> 03:03.062
I like things small and cute.

32
03:03.062 --> 03:04.185
Like you.

33
03:04.185 --> 03:06.131
- Keep your eyes wide open. - Okay.

34
03:07.390 --> 03:09.217
You're about to witness a miracle.

35
03:11.291 --> 03:13.250
- Bring them over. - Sorry?

36
03:13.250 --> 03:15.511
- The bags. - Oh, right!

37
03:15.511 --> 03:17.335
Not that one!

38
03:17.335 --> 03:18.847
- The boxy one! - The boxy one?

39
03:18.847 --> 03:20.180
- This one? - Yeah.

40
03:20.180 --> 03:21.182
- Hurry up. - Okay.

41
03:21.182 --> 03:22.425
Next!

42
03:23.935 --> 03:25.026
Next!

43
03:25.026 --> 03:27.339
- Bring two at a time! - Okay!

44
03:27.339 --> 03:29.114
Hurry up! Next!

45
03:31.840 --> 03:33.746
Next!

46
03:33.746 --> 03:35.205
[Yoon Ha Na]

47
03:35.205 --> 03:37.451
Okay, last one.

48
03:38.167 --> 03:40.000
Okay! Done!

49
03:40.000 --> 03:41.304
What do you think?

50
03:41.304 --> 03:46.123
Instead of playing it straight, try showing the opposite emotion.

51
03:46.123 --> 03:47.133
Got it.

52
03:47.133 --> 03:48.366
Got everything?

53
03:49.111 --> 03:52.548
Oh, my suitcase is in Dae Jun's car?

54
03:52.548 --> 03:53.926
Need something from it?

55
03:53.926 --> 03:55.485
Something important in there?

56
03:55.485 --> 03:57.625
- Then just take it all back out! - No!

57
03:57.625 --> 04:00.938
How are we supposed to unload all this again?

58
04:00.938 --> 04:03.629
Ha Na, if it's not urgent, let's just go.

59
04:03.629 --> 04:04.899
If it's loaded, I'm good.

60
04:04.899 --> 04:06.352
- Let's go. - Okay.

61
04:06.352 --> 04:08.258
- We're moving out! - Let's go.

62
04:08.258 --> 04:09.943
Move, move!

63
04:09.943 --> 04:11.596
- Let's go. - Ride with me.

64
04:11.596 --> 04:12.609
[Yoon Ha Na]

65
04:12.609 --> 04:13.909
See you there!

66
04:31.128 --> 04:32.966
Everyone, buckle up.

67
04:32.966 --> 04:34.554
- Yes! - Yes!

68
04:38.510 --> 04:39.941
- Well... - Yeah?

69
04:39.941 --> 04:41.283
By any chance...

70
04:41.283 --> 04:45.295
Can I eat bread in the car?

71
04:46.351 --> 04:48.309
Sure. Eat all you want.

72
04:48.309 --> 04:49.860
Thank you!

73
04:50.713 --> 04:52.571
If everyone's buckled up, let's go.

74
04:52.571 --> 04:54.666
- Okay. - Okay.

75
05:20.517 --> 05:23.036
It's exactly the same.

76
05:23.036 --> 05:24.758
That was...

77
05:25.451 --> 05:29.092
right around when Hyeong Won quit judo and disappeared.

78
05:30.405 --> 05:33.162
So I can't rule it out completely...

79
05:33.162 --> 05:35.480
But he had no reason to do that.

80
05:35.480 --> 05:39.180
He didn't even know Ha Na back then...

81
05:41.023 --> 05:42.855
What is this?

82
05:44.396 --> 05:46.802
What the hell is going on...

83
05:48.386 --> 05:50.108
[6 Hours Before the Incident] Soo Hyuk!

84
05:50.108 --> 05:51.814
- Yes! - This, this.

85
05:51.814 --> 05:53.398
Here you go.

86
05:53.398 --> 05:55.380
Here, take it.

87
05:57.325 --> 05:59.155
What's this? Oh, camera?

88
05:59.155 --> 06:00.711
Let me see.

89
06:01.438 --> 06:03.756
Should I put it here?

90
06:03.756 --> 06:06.013
- Jun Mo. - Yes?

91
06:06.013 --> 06:07.333
You came empty-handed, huh?

92
06:07.333 --> 06:08.708
Sorry?

93
06:09.474 --> 06:12.702
I knew you would, so I brought this.

94
06:12.702 --> 06:13.809
What's this?

95
06:13.809 --> 06:17.865
You're going to meet Ha Na's parents empty-handed?

96
06:17.865 --> 06:21.931
Wow, you really think of everything.

97
06:21.931 --> 06:23.023
Shall we go in?

98
06:23.023 --> 06:24.452
- Let's go. - Yeah.

99
06:32.189 --> 06:33.332
Hello.

100
06:33.332 --> 06:35.250
- Nice to meet you. - Mom, Dad.

101
06:35.250 --> 06:37.377
They're upperclassmen from film school.

102
06:37.377 --> 06:39.687
Welcome. You must be exhausted.

103
06:39.687 --> 06:43.551
You're all so young and fresh-faced.

104
06:43.551 --> 06:47.876
Come on, you're still young and pretty too.

105
06:48.644 --> 06:50.102
Nice to meet you.

106
06:50.102 --> 06:52.693
I'm Yang Jun Mo, the director of this film.

107
06:52.693 --> 06:55.586
Thanks so much for letting us stay here.

108
06:55.586 --> 06:57.804
Thank you.

109
06:59.495 --> 07:01.281
So...

110
07:01.281 --> 07:03.175
Ma'am, this is for you.

111
07:03.175 --> 07:04.993
What's all this?

112
07:04.993 --> 07:08.472
Oh, you didn't have to bring anything.

113
07:08.472 --> 07:10.603
They're sticky rice cakes from a famous shop.

114
07:10.603 --> 07:12.037
Have some if you need a snack.

115
07:12.037 --> 07:14.268
He waited in line to get them.

116
07:14.268 --> 07:16.295
Oh, thank you so much.

117
07:16.295 --> 07:17.924
Let's all have some.

118
07:17.924 --> 07:19.690
These are really famous.

119
07:19.690 --> 07:21.346
Thanks.

120
07:25.759 --> 07:27.886
- Welcome. - Hi, I'm Jun Hyuk.

121
07:27.886 --> 07:30.196
- I see. - I'm Jun Hyuk.

122
07:30.196 --> 07:31.381
- Hello! - Come in.

123
07:31.381 --> 07:33.278
You must be tired. Come on in.

124
07:33.278 --> 07:34.486
- Come in. - Hello.

125
07:34.486 --> 07:35.712
- Hello. - Hi.

126
07:35.712 --> 07:37.594
- Excuse us. - Of course.

127
07:37.594 --> 07:39.981
- You're so pretty. - Come in.

128
07:46.046 --> 07:47.517
- Ha Na. - Yes?

129
07:47.517 --> 07:49.004
Go help Mom.

130
07:49.004 --> 07:50.017
Yeah.

131
07:50.017 --> 07:51.526
Soo Hyuk.

132
08:04.783 --> 08:06.809
Hi, Lee Hyeong Won.

133
08:08.364 --> 08:10.537
What? What are you up to?

134
08:12.604 --> 08:15.097
Oh, grabbing some food?

135
08:15.097 --> 08:17.685
Let's eat together. I was getting hungry anyway.

136
08:17.685 --> 08:19.245
Get lost.

137
08:21.825 --> 08:24.421
Fine. Enjoy.

138
08:33.168 --> 08:35.253
The person you are calling is unavailable...

139
08:35.253 --> 08:37.478
Have they started filming already?

140
08:37.478 --> 08:41.347
Once they start, she won't check her phone.

141
08:41.347 --> 08:44.154
I can't make sense of this on my own...

142
08:44.154 --> 08:47.327
This is driving me crazy.

143
08:49.693 --> 08:52.262
- Can you clear this first? - Sure.

144
08:52.262 --> 08:54.507
As you know, these are day scenes.

145
08:54.507 --> 08:57.747
We're racing daylight, so we can't afford delays.

146
08:57.747 --> 08:59.004
- Let's keep moving. - Yeah.

147
08:59.004 --> 09:01.455
Ha Na, wrap it up.

148
09:01.455 --> 09:02.810
Sure.

149
09:05.624 --> 09:07.051
Done.

150
09:07.051 --> 09:08.964
Woo Jae, ready?

151
09:08.964 --> 09:10.324
Yeah.

152
09:11.417 --> 09:13.657
- Hey, Ha Na. - Yeah?

153
09:13.657 --> 09:16.368
You look really pretty today.

154
09:16.997 --> 09:19.308
Oh, just focus on your acting.

155
09:19.308 --> 09:21.445
All right, actors, stand by.

156
09:21.445 --> 09:22.860
Okay!

157
09:23.874 --> 09:25.651
- Let's go. - Yeah.

158
09:40.460 --> 09:42.764
Hey, where are you going?

159
09:44.225 --> 09:45.798
What the...

160
09:47.644 --> 09:50.883
Oh, you finished eating?

161
09:50.883 --> 09:52.466
Good.

162
09:53.710 --> 09:55.738
Get some rest.

163
10:06.889 --> 10:08.720
I need to use the bathroom.

164
10:35.874 --> 10:38.095
Hyeong Won, are you asleep?

165
10:38.095 --> 10:40.061
We need to talk.

166
10:43.157 --> 10:46.271
What? Where'd he go now?

167
10:47.431 --> 10:49.018
Darn it.

168
10:56.821 --> 10:58.557
[Seoul Bus Stop]

169
11:11.301 --> 11:13.103
[Joongwon Express] [Namseoul, Haesol]

170
11:14.698 --> 11:16.505
[That Summer, Us]

171
11:27.223 --> 11:28.669
[Vacant House]

172
11:32.643 --> 11:35.069
Why is he...

173
11:44.261 --> 11:47.047
[Day 1 of 4 of filming] [Filming location and time]

174
11:50.584 --> 11:53.157
Lee Hyeong Won, that bastard...

175
11:58.570 --> 11:59.590
[Yoon Ha Na]

176
12:02.730 --> 12:05.903
Please pick up, Yoon Ha Na.

177
12:06.684 --> 12:08.464
Damn it.

178
12:10.006 --> 12:12.105
[2 Hours Before the Incident]

179
12:13.130 --> 12:15.743
So Hee, what's your dream?

180
12:17.057 --> 12:20.039
Dreams are for people who can afford them.

181
12:20.937 --> 12:22.502
Still...

182
12:24.391 --> 12:27.717
Having pajeon loaded with squid on a rainy day?

183
12:30.110 --> 12:32.077
That's pretty modest.

184
12:33.164 --> 12:34.997
Seems that way, right?

185
12:35.904 --> 12:38.349
But even for that to happen...

186
12:38.349 --> 12:41.140
my dad has to come home sober.

187
12:42.636 --> 12:46.019
That's already a dream for me.

188
12:46.862 --> 12:49.261
And the gas bill has to be paid, too.

189
12:53.389 --> 12:55.389
[Beast]

190
13:08.368 --> 13:11.337
[Lodging: Ha Na's Family Home] [Filming Location: Haesol City]

191
14:09.088 --> 14:12.542
[Haesol Namchon]

192
14:12.542 --> 14:13.330
What?

193
14:13.330 --> 14:14.708
- Oh, my! - Cut! Rain!

194
14:14.708 --> 14:16.498
- Cover everything! - Get the gear!

195
14:16.498 --> 14:19.175
Get the actors and cameras covered!

196
14:19.852 --> 14:21.714
What the...

197
15:01.867 --> 15:04.799
- Your hands are really big. - Yeah?

198
15:04.799 --> 15:06.656
Yours are really small.

199
15:07.773 --> 15:09.159
Cute.

200
15:13.783 --> 15:16.494
Huh? What's that?

201
15:27.514 --> 15:28.694
A camcorder?

202
15:28.694 --> 15:31.065
I'm so scared.

203
15:31.065 --> 15:34.640
What if we suddenly get thrown into another future again?

204
15:35.292 --> 15:38.811
What if we can't see Woo Jae again?

205
15:38.811 --> 15:40.008
No.

206
15:40.008 --> 15:43.132
As long as we don't drop it, it should be okay.

207
15:44.424 --> 15:46.360
Hey! Why are you touching...

208
16:04.880 --> 16:07.040
Ha Na, what's wrong?

209
16:10.911 --> 16:12.618
Wait...

210
16:26.223 --> 16:28.189
No!

211
16:43.994 --> 16:46.040
Not yet...

212
16:46.040 --> 16:48.309
Not yet.

213
16:56.471 --> 16:57.639
Ha Na.

214
16:57.639 --> 16:58.665
You okay?

215
16:58.665 --> 17:00.226
Woo Jae.

216
17:00.226 --> 17:02.668
I have to go now.

217
17:02.668 --> 17:04.254
What?

218
17:04.254 --> 17:05.338
Where?

219
17:05.338 --> 17:06.582
I don't know.

220
17:06.582 --> 17:11.766
But if I go, I might never see you again.

221
17:12.891 --> 17:15.596
What are you talking about?

222
17:16.520 --> 17:19.232
Woo Jae, there's no time.

223
17:19.232 --> 17:20.854
You can't get hurt.

224
17:20.854 --> 17:22.905
You can't get sick either.

225
17:23.554 --> 17:25.820
Don't protect anyone else.

226
17:25.820 --> 17:28.364
Just protect yourself. Okay?

227
17:30.017 --> 17:33.036
- Ha Na, why are you suddenly... - Please...

228
17:33.717 --> 17:36.036
Please, Woo Jae. I'm begging you.

229
17:36.843 --> 17:38.564
Promise me.

230
17:42.211 --> 17:43.488
Okay.

231
17:43.488 --> 17:44.948
You mean it?

232
17:44.948 --> 17:46.937
You have to keep that promise.

233
17:46.937 --> 17:48.972
Let's meet again. No matter what.

234
17:53.126 --> 17:55.506
I don't want to go.

235
18:01.667 --> 18:03.256
Ha Na.

236
18:03.256 --> 18:05.057
Are you okay?

237
18:10.631 --> 18:13.916
You're okay, right?

238
18:13.916 --> 18:15.784
What?

239
18:15.784 --> 18:17.098
Why...

240
18:18.627 --> 18:20.933
Why am I still here?

241
18:26.854 --> 18:30.099
This isn't mine.

242
18:32.987 --> 18:34.803
Who the hell...

243
18:34.803 --> 18:37.083
Who would pull a prank like this...

244
18:39.537 --> 18:42.015
Ha Na, what's gotten into you?

245
18:42.015 --> 18:44.144
What was all that about?

246
18:44.144 --> 18:46.098
Woo Jae, I...

247
18:46.098 --> 18:48.608
Isn't this your camcorder?

248
18:48.608 --> 18:50.801
Should we go after that guy from earlier?

249
18:51.550 --> 18:52.837
Why?

250
18:52.837 --> 18:54.889
Talk to me, please.

251
18:59.147 --> 19:01.072
I...

252
19:01.072 --> 19:03.537
I think I got confused for a second.

253
19:04.790 --> 19:08.311
I get a little on edge when I'm filming.

254
19:08.311 --> 19:11.058
Maybe the rain got to me.

255
19:11.058 --> 19:13.177
Sorry if I scared you.

256
19:16.444 --> 19:19.011
It's really coming down. Let's go.

257
19:26.019 --> 19:27.495
Ha Na.

258
19:28.952 --> 19:30.753
Promise me too...

259
19:31.484 --> 19:35.624
that you'll tell me if you need help.

260
19:35.624 --> 19:37.532
Okay?

261
19:37.532 --> 19:39.662
I want to help you.

262
19:39.662 --> 19:41.532
Let me.

263
19:45.276 --> 19:47.602
I'm sorry, Woo Jae.

264
19:47.602 --> 19:50.156
Yeah. I will.

265
20:13.214 --> 20:15.956
Have some hot tea.

266
20:15.956 --> 20:17.728
You'll catch a cold.

267
20:17.728 --> 20:18.887
- Thank you. - Thanks.

268
20:18.887 --> 20:21.525
This is Ha Na's favorite tea.

269
20:21.525 --> 20:25.424
It's organic and microplastic-free, so it's perfectly safe.

270
20:25.424 --> 20:26.817
- Help yourselves. - Thank you!

271
20:26.817 --> 20:28.261
- Thank you. - Thank you.

272
20:28.261 --> 20:29.737
Thanks.

273
20:30.377 --> 20:32.542
Why aren't Woo Jae and Ha Na back yet?

274
20:32.542 --> 20:34.562
Maybe they still have more to talk about.

275
20:34.562 --> 20:38.675
They're probably off somewhere flirting.

276
20:38.675 --> 20:40.381
Dae Jun.

277
20:46.810 --> 20:48.316
Hey, son.

278
20:52.461 --> 20:53.499
Yeah?

279
20:53.499 --> 20:56.292
So she's with Woo Jae right now?

280
20:56.292 --> 20:58.569
- She's not alone, is she? - Of course.

281
20:58.569 --> 21:01.946
It suddenly started pouring, so everyone's back at the house now.

282
21:01.946 --> 21:04.030
Sounds like she's coming with Woo Jae.

283
21:04.030 --> 21:05.277
Why?

284
21:05.277 --> 21:06.841
Something wrong?

285
21:06.841 --> 21:08.754
Nothing.

286
21:08.754 --> 21:10.345
I'm almost there.

287
21:10.345 --> 21:12.218
See you at home, Dad.

288
21:21.204 --> 21:24.314
Man, today's a great day.

289
21:24.314 --> 21:27.114
Both my kids are coming home at once.

290
21:29.434 --> 21:30.637
All right.

291
21:30.637 --> 21:33.691
Let's do it right the first time. I don't want to do this twice.

292
21:33.691 --> 21:34.990
Yes!

293
21:35.963 --> 21:38.039
Sometimes I swear she's my senior.

294
21:38.039 --> 21:40.531
Just think of her as your senior.

295
21:40.531 --> 21:42.068
- Makes life easier. - Heave-ho!

296
21:42.068 --> 21:44.710
But I'm supposed to be the senior...

297
21:46.244 --> 21:48.681
You're soaked. Have some tea.

298
21:48.681 --> 21:50.472
It's your favorite.

299
21:50.472 --> 21:53.768
It's organic and microplastic-free...

300
21:53.768 --> 21:54.965
What?

301
21:54.965 --> 21:55.994
What's wrong with her?

302
21:55.994 --> 21:58.331
Did something happen?

303
21:58.331 --> 22:01.234
She said she needs to find something right away.

304
22:01.234 --> 22:03.038
Oh, I see.

305
22:05.982 --> 22:07.540
Want some?

306
22:07.540 --> 22:09.653
Yeah. Thank you.

307
22:09.653 --> 22:11.446
- It's organic. - Thanks.

308
22:20.195 --> 22:21.983
It's gone.

309
22:26.868 --> 22:28.811
Then what's this...

310
22:33.903 --> 22:36.878
It was definitely there this morning.

311
22:36.878 --> 22:38.878
So when?

312
22:44.144 --> 22:46.907
I came straight from school to the set this morning.

313
22:46.907 --> 22:49.727
Only Woo Jae and my classmates were at the house.

314
22:49.727 --> 22:51.306
Then...

315
23:00.175 --> 23:01.945
Does that mean...

316
23:01.945 --> 23:05.232
it was one of my classmates?

317
23:05.232 --> 23:07.354
Who?

318
23:13.051 --> 23:14.249
Yoon Ha Na.

319
23:14.249 --> 23:17.082
I left your bag, script, and phone in the living room.

320
23:17.082 --> 23:18.212
Make sure you grab them.

321
23:18.212 --> 23:19.517
Okay.

322
23:23.939 --> 23:25.705
- This is the part, right? - Yeah.

323
23:28.839 --> 23:31.148
Ha Na starts at 23-1...

324
23:31.148 --> 23:32.741
From 23-1...

325
23:34.105 --> 23:35.576
- My son. You're here. - Hi, Dad!

326
23:35.576 --> 23:36.985
Yoon Ha Na...

327
23:37.916 --> 23:40.811
What are you doing here all of a sudden?

328
23:44.916 --> 23:46.562
Hi, Boss.

329
23:47.936 --> 23:49.800
Is he here to see me?

330
23:49.800 --> 23:52.060
- Oh, my... - Hello, everyone.

331
23:52.060 --> 23:55.332
I'm Ha Na's twin brother, Yoon Ha Ru.

332
23:56.540 --> 24:00.424
If I can help with the shoot, put me to work.

333
24:00.424 --> 24:03.854
For the duration, I'm all yours.

334
24:05.098 --> 24:06.275
Well...

335
24:06.275 --> 24:07.819
He is Ha Na's brother.

336
24:07.819 --> 24:10.514
And an extra pair of hands would help.

337
24:10.514 --> 24:12.964
Sounds good to us.

338
24:12.964 --> 24:15.030
- Right, Jun Mo? - Huh?

339
24:16.147 --> 24:18.445
Yeah, we'd appreciate the help.

340
24:18.445 --> 24:20.525
Glad to have you, Ha Ru.

341
24:21.473 --> 24:23.291
- My little sister. - Not me?

342
24:23.291 --> 24:25.328
Your big brother needs a word with you.

343
24:25.328 --> 24:29.487
Mind if we talk in private?

344
24:29.487 --> 24:32.047
- Sure. Go ahead. - Thanks.

345
24:32.047 --> 24:33.847
Come here, quick.

346
24:37.887 --> 24:39.705
What was I expecting?

347
24:39.705 --> 24:42.068
Seo Ye Rang, you're ridiculous...

348
24:42.068 --> 24:43.791
Woo Jae.

349
24:43.791 --> 24:46.203
Ha Ru's acting weird today, right?

350
24:46.934 --> 24:49.412
Ha Ru being weird is nothing new.

351
24:49.412 --> 24:50.680
What?

352
24:50.680 --> 24:53.741
Honestly, he seems better than usual today.

353
24:56.731 --> 24:58.448
Woo Jae, you're hilarious.

354
24:58.448 --> 25:00.472
You're getting funnier.

355
25:00.472 --> 25:03.512
Look at you, Woo Jae...

356
25:06.267 --> 25:08.137
The stalker who killed Woo Jae,

357
25:08.137 --> 25:10.161
the one who stole the real camcorder,

358
25:10.161 --> 25:13.085
and the guy who dropped the fake one right in front of me...

359
25:13.085 --> 25:15.431
You're saying Hyeong Won did all that?

360
25:15.431 --> 25:18.768
And he's somewhere around here right now?

361
25:18.768 --> 25:21.168
He got the shooting schedule too.

362
25:21.168 --> 25:23.325
He knows our address and everything.

363
25:23.325 --> 25:25.453
He could easily come here if he wanted.

364
25:25.453 --> 25:29.393
He's definitely in Haesol City.

365
25:29.393 --> 25:31.797
He should've gotten here before me...

366
25:31.797 --> 25:33.910
so why is he still hiding?

367
25:33.910 --> 25:36.557
But why?

368
25:36.557 --> 25:38.760
Is it really Hyeong Won?

369
25:39.434 --> 25:41.887
The scar was identical.

370
25:42.522 --> 25:45.267
And if he couldn't do it alone,

371
25:45.267 --> 25:49.197
maybe one of your film classmates is helping him.

372
25:49.197 --> 25:50.856
No way...

373
25:55.092 --> 25:58.453
I saw that man around 3:30.

374
25:58.453 --> 26:01.552
We were all at the set from 11,

375
26:01.552 --> 26:04.676
so no one could've taken it from the house.

376
26:04.676 --> 26:08.222
It had to be before we left...

377
26:13.594 --> 26:15.062
Yoon Ha Na.

378
26:15.889 --> 26:17.366
Look at me.

379
26:19.570 --> 26:21.627
We've handled everything so far,

380
26:21.627 --> 26:23.387
and we'll handle this too.

381
26:23.387 --> 26:25.243
Stay sharp.

382
26:25.939 --> 26:27.446
Okay.

383
26:28.993 --> 26:32.308
Let's stay calm and think.

384
26:33.240 --> 26:37.940
Anyone come to mind who might help Hyeong Won?

385
26:44.618 --> 26:47.335
I barely made anything, and you're all digging in.

386
26:47.335 --> 26:48.742
- Thank you! - Thank you!

387
26:48.742 --> 26:49.973
Oh, right.

388
26:49.973 --> 26:52.152
Come by my restaurant after tonight's shoot.

389
26:52.152 --> 26:54.580
I'll make you a real feast.

390
26:54.580 --> 26:55.520
Awesome!

391
26:55.520 --> 26:57.509
Gook luck, film crew!

392
26:57.509 --> 26:59.287
- Thank you! - Thank you!

393
26:59.287 --> 27:00.933
We love you!

394
27:02.553 --> 27:04.677
What about a guy named Dae Jun?

395
27:04.677 --> 27:06.570
Dae Jun?

396
27:09.444 --> 27:13.441
He took Hyeong Won under his wing after he was cast.

397
27:13.441 --> 27:16.608
He even talked about getting him a special appearance in his next project.

398
27:16.608 --> 27:18.665
Woo Jae. Open wide.

399
27:18.665 --> 27:20.435
- Sorry? - Ah.

400
27:20.435 --> 27:21.721
Ah...

401
27:22.631 --> 27:24.316
But Hyeong Won isn't the only one.

402
27:24.316 --> 27:27.188
He's been taking good care of Woo Jae too.

403
27:27.188 --> 27:29.208
He wants him as the lead in his next project.

404
27:30.235 --> 27:32.504
What about that director guy?

405
27:33.208 --> 27:35.059
Jun Mo?

406
27:36.802 --> 27:39.146
Hyeong Won backed out right before the shoot.

407
27:39.146 --> 27:41.551
Jun Mo went through hell because of him.

408
27:41.551 --> 27:43.039
No way...

409
27:48.363 --> 27:51.862
Why are you looking at me like that? Did I do something wrong?

410
27:53.782 --> 27:54.946
Yoon Ha Ru!

411
27:54.946 --> 27:58.134
I know you're curious, but don't stare. It's rude.

412
27:58.134 --> 27:59.473
Oh, sorry.

413
27:59.473 --> 28:04.719
I've never met a film director before.

414
28:04.719 --> 28:06.003
I got curious.

415
28:06.003 --> 28:08.183
I see. It's okay.

416
28:08.183 --> 28:09.619
Yeah.

417
28:14.356 --> 28:16.780
Seo Ye Rang is definitely out.

418
28:16.780 --> 28:18.760
Obviously.

419
28:21.293 --> 28:23.327
What about Soo Hyuk?

420
28:26.214 --> 28:28.192
Of course not.

421
28:28.960 --> 28:33.104
What about that guy with the weird metal case?

422
28:33.104 --> 28:34.938
Jun Hyuk?

423
28:37.824 --> 28:40.101
What's in that metal case?

424
28:40.101 --> 28:42.536
He's been carrying it around even inside the house.

425
28:42.536 --> 28:45.556
What if the camcorder's in there?

426
28:45.556 --> 28:48.303
Probably just camera lenses.

427
28:48.303 --> 28:49.900
Have you actually checked?

428
28:49.900 --> 28:53.077
No one wants to open that thing...

429
28:54.481 --> 28:57.973
Leave the metal case to me.

430
28:58.708 --> 29:00.232
Sir?

431
29:00.232 --> 29:01.552
Oh, Ha Ru.

432
29:01.552 --> 29:03.746
You already remembered my name.

433
29:06.628 --> 29:09.274
That case of yours...

434
29:10.441 --> 29:13.097
There's just something about it.

435
29:13.097 --> 29:17.348
Like it belongs in the hands of a true artist.

436
29:17.348 --> 29:20.568
It has this radiant aura.

437
29:20.568 --> 29:22.433
Ha Ru.

438
29:23.139 --> 29:25.139
You have an excellent eye.

439
29:25.139 --> 29:28.469
What's inside?

440
29:28.469 --> 29:32.564
The scientific subjects which are made of 68 years of Helioke and 58 years of Roica.

441
29:32.564 --> 29:34.161
Would you like to see?

442
29:38.360 --> 29:40.091
After the meal,

443
29:40.091 --> 29:43.700
I'll make a special exception and show you.

444
29:45.372 --> 29:47.273
Thank you, sir.

445
29:52.500 --> 29:54.446
And the only one left is...

446
29:54.446 --> 29:56.219
Shin Bi Gyeong?

447
29:56.219 --> 29:58.976
The person in the raincoat had a completely different build.

448
29:58.976 --> 30:00.537
He was a big guy.

449
30:00.537 --> 30:04.556
She still could've stolen the camcorder and passed it to him.

450
30:04.556 --> 30:07.046
Yeah, she kept trying to get close to him

451
30:07.046 --> 30:09.689
after he moved into the shared house.

452
30:09.689 --> 30:13.695
But... I didn't think she was that bad.

453
30:14.672 --> 30:18.172
Then who else could it be?

454
30:18.172 --> 30:21.349
Someone here has to be helping Hyeong Won.

455
30:21.349 --> 30:22.676
Yoon Ha Na. Yoon Ha Ru.

456
30:22.676 --> 30:24.096
- Yes! - Yes!

457
30:26.516 --> 30:29.202
You two okay?

458
30:29.202 --> 30:31.007
Yeah. Why?

459
30:31.007 --> 30:32.704
What's so weird?

460
30:32.704 --> 30:34.491
Why aren't you eating?

461
30:34.491 --> 30:35.661
You feeling sick?

462
30:35.661 --> 30:37.421
No, I'm fine.

463
30:38.011 --> 30:40.042
Are you sure you're okay?

464
30:40.042 --> 30:42.894
- Ha Ru, you're okay, huh? - Totally. Never better.

465
30:42.894 --> 30:44.613
Me too.

466
30:45.713 --> 30:47.784
Gang Ho!

467
30:47.784 --> 30:49.372
Have some more!

468
30:49.372 --> 30:52.562
The food is really good.

469
30:52.562 --> 30:54.522
- Eat up. - Yeah.

470
30:56.577 --> 30:58.643
Woo Jae, try this too.

471
31:14.556 --> 31:16.211
Did you check?

472
31:21.328 --> 31:22.832
This is a pair of stockings.

473
31:22.832 --> 31:26.682
Once he opens that case, that's at least 30 minutes.

474
31:26.682 --> 31:30.367
He'll go on forever about vintage lenses.

475
31:31.972 --> 31:33.163
Got it?

476
31:33.163 --> 31:35.822
He's so cheerful you can't even cut him off.

477
31:37.712 --> 31:39.933
No camcorder.

478
31:40.632 --> 31:43.225
I sat through his vintage-lens lecture and...

479
31:43.872 --> 31:45.634
it's already dark?

480
31:49.275 --> 31:50.332
Don't worry.

481
31:50.332 --> 31:52.445
I'll stay right by your side and keep watch.

482
31:52.445 --> 31:55.555
For now, trust no one. Suspect everyone.

483
31:55.555 --> 31:56.849
Okay?

484
31:56.849 --> 31:58.222
Okay.

485
31:59.481 --> 32:02.172
Let's go back inside.

486
32:24.660 --> 32:26.318
Let's wrap things up.

487
32:26.318 --> 32:28.713
We leave in 15 minutes!

488
32:34.888 --> 32:36.514
- This... - The camera goes over there.

489
32:36.514 --> 32:38.280
- Over there? - Yeah.

490
32:40.337 --> 32:42.690
- Can you put this here? - Sure.

491
32:43.472 --> 32:46.199
- This one's yours. - Thanks.

492
32:46.199 --> 32:47.938
- Do this first. - Sure.

493
32:48.671 --> 32:51.131
- Like this? - Yeah.

494
32:56.831 --> 32:59.205
I'm pretty good at following directions, right?

495
32:59.205 --> 33:01.142
You're not bad.

496
33:01.142 --> 33:03.564
What else can I do?

497
33:03.564 --> 33:06.481
- I'll show you how to check continuity. - Okay.

498
33:06.481 --> 33:07.811
- Continuity? - Yeah.

499
33:07.811 --> 33:09.958
If an actor's hair falls like this...

500
33:09.958 --> 33:12.684
you note the hair here...

501
33:12.684 --> 33:16.094
And... anything that's flipped over...

502
33:16.094 --> 33:17.866
Are you always this busy between takes?

503
33:17.866 --> 33:20.162
Maybe we could talk...

504
33:20.162 --> 33:22.426
- Just work. - Okay.

505
33:22.426 --> 33:24.043
Bring me that.

506
33:24.043 --> 33:25.696
Oh, okay.

507
33:40.349 --> 33:42.193
Hurry it up.

508
33:42.193 --> 33:43.904
Okay.

509
33:43.904 --> 33:45.695
I'm an acting major...

510
33:45.695 --> 33:47.737
At this rate, I'll graduate doing nothing but cables.

511
33:47.737 --> 33:49.990
I'm so sick of this.

512
33:49.990 --> 33:53.221
Why are there so many damn cables?

513
33:53.221 --> 33:55.864
- Bi Gyeong. - Yes?

514
33:56.890 --> 34:01.232
If I become a director, I'll cast you as my lead.

515
34:01.232 --> 34:03.665
You're an acting major too.

516
34:05.439 --> 34:07.079
Then...

517
34:09.459 --> 34:11.932
I'll give you everything I've got!

518
34:14.479 --> 34:16.123
Thanks.

519
34:16.123 --> 34:18.859
Get lost! Now!

520
34:20.216 --> 34:22.659
Hey, come here.

521
34:22.659 --> 34:24.911
Take this and get lost.

522
34:24.911 --> 34:27.064
Bi Gyeong, that's enough there.

523
34:27.064 --> 34:28.897
Spray some bug spray around the sides.

524
34:28.897 --> 34:30.414
Okay.

525
34:30.414 --> 34:32.732
Hey, pig! Get that cable over here!

526
34:32.732 --> 34:34.165
Okay...

527
34:34.165 --> 34:37.249
Gang Ho's here, and So Hee...

528
34:37.933 --> 34:42.225
She meets him by the bench, and sits down.

529
34:42.225 --> 34:44.035
- Okay. - Good.

530
34:44.035 --> 34:46.112
- Stay here a second. - Okay.

531
34:46.112 --> 34:47.629
Oh, Gang Ho!

532
34:47.629 --> 34:49.896
The banana milk was a nice touch.

533
34:49.896 --> 34:51.529
Thank you.

534
34:56.247 --> 35:00.340
When did you get the banana milk?

535
35:01.915 --> 35:03.699
I just thought...

536
35:03.699 --> 35:09.272
what Gang Ho would have ready for So Hee after a long day.

537
35:09.272 --> 35:11.854
It just came to me.

538
35:11.854 --> 35:14.727
So Hee keeps reminding me of you.

539
35:24.026 --> 35:26.476
Can't see a single star.

540
35:28.383 --> 35:31.194
It's too bright here.

541
35:31.194 --> 35:33.760
Once the lights are off, you'll see tons.

542
35:33.760 --> 35:35.311
Yeah.

543
35:35.311 --> 35:39.513
Even if we can't see them now, they're all shining up there.

544
35:40.569 --> 35:42.763
Yeah.

545
35:42.763 --> 35:46.096
I don't know when or how I'll have to say goodbye to him.

546
35:50.932 --> 35:52.335
Please...

547
35:52.335 --> 35:55.265
Just let us finish the shoot.

548
35:55.265 --> 35:57.034
Please.

549
36:04.827 --> 36:06.356
Woo Jae.

550
36:07.335 --> 36:08.616
Yeah?

551
36:12.098 --> 36:13.752
What is it?

552
36:14.758 --> 36:16.424
Don't...

553
36:17.991 --> 36:20.077
become a bodyguard.

554
36:20.804 --> 36:22.309
What?

555
36:22.309 --> 36:24.533
Don't take a job where you get hurt

556
36:25.290 --> 36:27.967
protecting other people.

557
36:29.002 --> 36:30.877
Please.

558
36:32.589 --> 36:35.469
- Ha Na, what are you talking... - Don't.

559
36:38.823 --> 36:41.260
Where is this coming from?

560
36:41.260 --> 36:44.396
Being a bodyguard was never your dream.

561
36:44.396 --> 36:46.760
Even if you can't do judo anymore...

562
36:46.760 --> 36:50.957
you can find something else you really want to do.

563
36:50.957 --> 36:52.607
Right?

564
36:52.607 --> 36:54.701
You're good at so many things.

565
36:54.701 --> 36:56.865
You were good at acting today. You've got talent.

566
36:56.865 --> 37:00.136
You're good at sports too.

567
37:00.136 --> 37:02.492
You can sing.

568
37:02.492 --> 37:04.220
You take great pictures too.

569
37:04.220 --> 37:06.650
- All the pictures you took of me... - Ha Na.

570
37:10.943 --> 37:12.520
I'm...

571
37:13.380 --> 37:15.372
going to be a bodyguard.

572
37:16.466 --> 37:17.926
What?

573
37:21.263 --> 37:24.410
I've thought about it a lot since I quit judo.

574
37:27.926 --> 37:30.188
My dream is...

575
37:30.188 --> 37:31.561
you.

576
37:33.147 --> 37:35.527
I want to protect you, Ha Na.

577
37:37.572 --> 37:42.043
When you become a great actress, I'll protect you.

578
37:43.105 --> 37:45.081
That's my dream.

579
37:48.248 --> 37:50.568
Everyone, standby!

580
38:15.415 --> 38:17.889
Cut. Okay!

581
38:17.889 --> 38:20.726
Change So Hee's outfit, then we'll pick up right away.

582
38:21.962 --> 38:25.212
So Hee's changing wardrobe. We'll pick up right after.

583
38:25.212 --> 38:26.594
Yes!

584
38:31.632 --> 38:32.656
Darn it.

585
38:32.656 --> 38:34.040
Hey, Bi Gyeong!

586
38:34.040 --> 38:37.346
I need to wipe down the camera. Go grab a towel.

587
38:37.346 --> 38:39.596
- Hurry, hurry! - Okay.

588
38:39.596 --> 38:41.386
Why do they always make me do it?

589
38:41.386 --> 38:43.512
I think you should play it like this.

590
38:43.512 --> 38:45.663
Ha Na's here. Let's get ready.

591
38:54.898 --> 38:56.361
Ha Na!

592
39:13.596 --> 39:14.934
Ha Ru, you okay?

593
39:14.934 --> 39:16.374
Bi Gyeong!

594
39:16.374 --> 39:18.971
- Are you okay? - Woo Jae, you okay?

595
39:18.971 --> 39:20.322
- Bi Gyeong! - Are you hurt?

596
39:20.322 --> 39:22.167
You really okay?

597
39:23.737 --> 39:25.330
You okay?

598
39:28.226 --> 39:29.726
Hey, you okay?

599
39:38.030 --> 39:40.603
- Are you all right, Woo Jae? - Oh, yes.

600
39:51.656 --> 39:53.122
Come on.

601
39:54.228 --> 39:56.629
This isn't the time to joke around.

602
39:58.935 --> 40:00.754
Are you okay, Woo Jae?

603
40:03.806 --> 40:04.817
Hey!

604
40:04.817 --> 40:06.179
Jeez...

605
40:15.304 --> 40:16.781
Good work, everyone.

606
40:16.781 --> 40:18.514
That was quite a shock.

607
40:18.514 --> 40:20.620
But I'm glad no one got seriously hurt.

608
40:20.620 --> 40:24.558
Don't worry. We'll finish it tomorrow night.

609
40:24.558 --> 40:26.888
Gang Ho, So Hee. Tell me if you're not feeling well.

610
40:26.888 --> 40:28.105
Okay.

611
40:28.105 --> 40:28.989
Okay.

612
40:28.989 --> 40:33.172
Ha Ru, thank you. And I'm sorry.

613
40:33.172 --> 40:35.395
I'm really fine.

614
40:39.753 --> 40:41.300
That hurts!

615
40:42.086 --> 40:43.449
Bi Gyeong.

616
40:44.075 --> 40:45.097
Yes...

617
40:45.097 --> 40:46.774
Don't beat yourself up.

618
40:46.774 --> 40:49.967
It wasn't just your fault.

619
40:49.967 --> 40:50.991
Okay?

620
40:50.991 --> 40:54.302
Let's all be more careful next time.

621
40:54.302 --> 40:55.341
- Okay. - Yes.

622
40:55.341 --> 40:56.701
I, Han Soo Hyuk!

623
40:56.701 --> 41:01.071
I'll help my seniors and be extra careful from now on!

624
41:01.071 --> 41:04.021
Good. That's our youngest.

625
41:04.021 --> 41:07.358
But seriously, casting Gang Ho was spot-on.

626
41:07.358 --> 41:09.382
For a second, I really thought Woo Jae was Gang Ho.

627
41:09.382 --> 41:11.523
Hey. Ha Ru too.

628
41:11.523 --> 41:13.907
He was like another Gang Ho.

629
41:13.907 --> 41:14.958
Totally.

630
41:14.958 --> 41:18.148
Ha Na's surrounded by Gang Hos.

631
41:18.148 --> 41:19.679
The big emotional scene is tomorrow.

632
41:19.679 --> 41:22.591
Get some rest, and let's keep tomorrow's shoot safe.

633
41:22.591 --> 41:24.963
- Yes! - Yes!

634
41:24.963 --> 41:28.945
Maybe the movie really will be a hit.

635
41:31.076 --> 41:32.601
Ha Na.

636
41:41.370 --> 41:45.842
I really must've looked like Gang Ho, huh?

637
41:46.864 --> 41:49.017
Hey, Jung Woo Jae.

638
42:00.930 --> 42:02.490
Come outside.

639
42:10.688 --> 42:11.925
What...

640
42:11.925 --> 42:13.611
What's wrong with him?

641
42:28.946 --> 42:33.918
He got hurt again saving me...

642
42:37.039 --> 42:39.063
If I want to protect him,

643
42:39.063 --> 42:42.300
I have to disappear from his life.

644
42:42.300 --> 42:44.839
So he can't save me anymore.

645
42:49.812 --> 42:51.445
You...

646
42:53.512 --> 42:55.946
Stop making me feel guilty.

647
42:58.730 --> 43:02.527
What do you mean, Ha Na?

648
43:02.527 --> 43:05.685
Did I do something to make you uncomfortable?

649
43:05.685 --> 43:08.791
Saving me because I'm in danger.

650
43:08.791 --> 43:11.735
Getting hurt because of me.

651
43:11.735 --> 43:15.021
Helping me when I never asked, then making me feel guilty.

652
43:15.021 --> 43:17.114
I hate that.

653
43:19.154 --> 43:21.259
That sacrifice... it's not for me.

654
43:21.259 --> 43:23.667
It's for you.

655
43:23.667 --> 43:26.373
You get to be the good guy.

656
43:27.072 --> 43:29.018
But what about me?

657
43:29.018 --> 43:31.142
How do you think that makes me feel?

658
43:36.960 --> 43:40.185
Like I'm helpless. Like all I do is cause trouble.

659
43:41.689 --> 43:43.135
That's...

660
43:44.560 --> 43:46.802
That's what you make me feel like.

661
43:51.408 --> 43:53.071
I'm asking you.

662
43:53.071 --> 43:54.811
Please.

663
43:56.685 --> 43:58.858
Just live for yourself.

664
44:02.697 --> 44:04.836
Don't push me.

665
44:17.081 --> 44:19.222
I'm sorry, Woo Jae.

666
44:19.222 --> 44:20.770
I'm sorry.

667
44:25.655 --> 44:27.191
You can't get hurt.

668
44:27.191 --> 44:29.227
You can't get sick either.

669
44:29.923 --> 44:32.235
Don't protect anyone else.

670
44:32.235 --> 44:34.641
Just protect yourself. Okay?

671
44:42.230 --> 44:43.843
You okay?

672
44:57.133 --> 44:58.154
What?

673
44:58.154 --> 44:59.932
- What's wrong? - What?

674
44:59.932 --> 45:00.807
- Why are you... - What?

675
45:00.807 --> 45:04.560
That was more dramatic than the movie we're shooting.

676
45:04.560 --> 45:06.665
Yoon Ha Na. She's seriously something else.

677
45:06.665 --> 45:09.010
If I were Woo Jae, I'd be on the floor crying.

678
45:09.010 --> 45:11.414
Poor Woo Jae... He must be crushed.

679
45:11.414 --> 45:13.312
What happened?

680
45:13.312 --> 45:14.612
- No! - What?

681
45:14.612 --> 45:17.284
Don't tell them anything.

682
45:17.284 --> 45:19.113
I'm not going to.

683
45:19.113 --> 45:21.201
What on earth happened?

684
45:32.466 --> 45:34.031
Jung Woo Jae.

685
45:34.798 --> 45:36.651
What?

686
45:36.651 --> 45:38.218
Where's Ha Na?

687
45:43.308 --> 45:46.008
Where is she? Tell me!

688
46:17.924 --> 46:19.548
Ha Na!

689
46:19.548 --> 46:21.088
Yoon Ha Na!

690
46:22.411 --> 46:23.445
We couldn't find her.

691
46:23.445 --> 46:24.449
- Really? - Yeah.

692
46:24.449 --> 46:26.135
She's not here either.

693
46:26.854 --> 46:29.152
- I don't think she's here. - Where the hell did she go?

694
46:29.152 --> 46:30.786
Let's keep looking.

695
46:30.786 --> 46:32.179
I'll check over there.

696
46:32.179 --> 46:33.423
I'll come with you.

697
46:33.423 --> 46:35.049
Then we'll go this way.

698
46:35.049 --> 46:36.510
Me too.

699
46:36.510 --> 46:38.767
- This way! - Let's go!

700
46:38.767 --> 46:40.090
- Let's go. - Yoon Ha Na!

701
46:40.090 --> 46:42.393
Did something happen with her?

702
46:42.393 --> 46:44.179
Or maybe...

703
46:44.179 --> 46:45.549
No.

704
46:45.549 --> 46:47.529
Nothing happened, but...

705
46:47.529 --> 46:49.832
It's kind of scary looking for her at night...

706
46:49.832 --> 46:52.475
I'm here. Don't worry.

707
46:53.275 --> 46:56.441
Why do you keep talking to me so casually?

708
46:57.172 --> 46:59.658
Let's find Ha Na first.

709
47:02.082 --> 47:04.488
- I'll check this way. You go that way. - Okay.

710
47:28.836 --> 47:30.107
Sorry.

711
47:30.107 --> 47:31.568
Did I scare you?

712
47:32.693 --> 47:35.531
- Jun Mo... - What are you doing out here alone?

713
47:35.531 --> 47:37.986
Everyone's looking for you.

714
47:39.165 --> 47:41.589
Oh, sorry.

715
47:55.186 --> 47:56.993
You okay?

716
47:57.899 --> 48:00.350
Yeah, I'm fine.

717
48:01.512 --> 48:03.795
I guess I was just a little on edge.

718
48:03.795 --> 48:05.128
Sorry.

719
48:06.217 --> 48:07.938
You know...

720
48:09.158 --> 48:13.309
you always keep me at a distance.

721
48:14.082 --> 48:16.029
Me? With you?

722
48:16.029 --> 48:18.584
- No, I don't. - Sure you do.

723
48:18.584 --> 48:22.587
Everyone thinks we're so close.

724
48:22.587 --> 48:25.883
But honestly... I know you the least.

725
48:25.883 --> 48:27.738
Yeah?

726
48:27.738 --> 48:31.649
You know I'm an open book.

727
48:31.649 --> 48:33.247
See?

728
48:33.247 --> 48:35.586
You're doing it again.

729
48:37.792 --> 48:40.678
Then again... I'm older.

730
48:41.478 --> 48:44.320
I've got presence. I've got fame.

731
48:44.320 --> 48:47.113
And with a face like this... I get it.

732
48:47.113 --> 48:50.583
I can be a little intimidating.

733
48:51.572 --> 48:53.203
Oh, please.

734
48:53.203 --> 48:54.974
There. You're finally smiling.

735
48:55.820 --> 48:57.873
Just relax around me.

736
48:58.779 --> 49:00.349
Okay.

737
49:00.349 --> 49:01.842
Thanks.

738
49:02.462 --> 49:03.968
Yoon Ha Na!

739
49:05.536 --> 49:07.319
Lee Hyeong Won?

740
49:14.822 --> 49:16.846
What are you doing here?

741
49:16.846 --> 49:19.717
I need to talk to her.

742
49:25.613 --> 49:28.323
I need to work on the script anyway, so I'll head back.

743
49:28.323 --> 49:30.852
- I'll come with you... - Please do.

744
49:35.065 --> 49:37.408
Everyone's worried about you, so don't stay out too late.

745
49:56.498 --> 49:58.792
- She's not there, right? - No.

746
49:58.792 --> 50:00.196
She definitely walked out.

747
50:00.196 --> 50:01.516
Why can't we find her?

748
50:01.516 --> 50:03.726
We checked everywhere nearby.

749
50:03.726 --> 50:06.986
Where did she go this late at night?

750
50:06.986 --> 50:08.483
Let's search again.

751
50:08.483 --> 50:09.496
Okay, look.

752
50:09.496 --> 50:10.886
She's 163 centimeters tall.

753
50:10.886 --> 50:13.289
With a 70-centimeter stride and her nighttime walking pace...

754
50:13.289 --> 50:14.642
that's about 60 meters a minute.

755
50:14.642 --> 50:17.529
In 30 minutes, she'd only get about a kilometer away.

756
50:17.529 --> 50:19.522
We should've crossed paths with her a few times by now.

757
50:19.522 --> 50:21.732
So why haven't we seen her?

758
50:21.732 --> 50:23.496
This is driving me crazy.

759
50:23.496 --> 50:27.102
She probably took an unlit farm road or riverside path.

760
50:27.102 --> 50:29.033
What do we do?

761
50:29.033 --> 50:31.489
I'll take the car and search farther out.

762
50:32.315 --> 50:33.948
Jun Mo!

763
50:35.475 --> 50:36.607
Guys.

764
50:36.607 --> 50:38.525
- I found her. - What?

765
50:38.525 --> 50:39.982
Then why are you alone?

766
50:39.982 --> 50:42.590
Hyeong Won showed up.

767
50:43.270 --> 50:44.602
It looked like something personal.

768
50:44.602 --> 50:46.340
So I left them alone. She'll be back soon.

769
50:46.340 --> 50:48.365
Where is she right now?

770
50:48.365 --> 50:50.920
In the alley out back...

771
50:50.920 --> 50:52.436
I'm coming with you!

772
50:53.155 --> 50:55.608
It's dangerous. Stay here.

773
50:58.191 --> 50:59.898
"Dangerous?"

774
50:59.898 --> 51:02.284
Then I'm not letting you go alone.

775
51:03.754 --> 51:06.598
She doesn't even know where she's going...

776
51:06.598 --> 51:08.631
I'll go after them.

777
51:10.323 --> 51:12.691
We'll wait inside.

778
51:27.815 --> 51:28.859
That bastard...

779
51:28.859 --> 51:30.639
The scar on his arm.

780
51:30.639 --> 51:32.726
I definitely saw it.

781
51:32.726 --> 51:34.592
It was you.

782
51:37.676 --> 51:39.250
What was?

783
51:59.391 --> 52:01.128
Lee Hyeong Won!

784
52:06.125 --> 52:07.474
Jung Woo Jae!

785
52:07.474 --> 52:10.284
What the hell are you doing?

786
52:10.991 --> 52:14.380
Was that you in the raincoat earlier?

787
52:14.380 --> 52:16.351
What crap?

788
52:17.207 --> 52:19.706
Hey. Are you okay?

789
52:21.220 --> 52:22.920
Ha Na, hold on.

790
52:24.027 --> 52:27.358
I always pay people back.

791
52:35.352 --> 52:36.622
Jung Woo Jae!

792
52:36.622 --> 52:38.179
Stop...

793
52:39.059 --> 52:40.898
Please, stop.

794
52:57.137 --> 52:58.326
Yoon Ha Na!

795
52:58.326 --> 52:59.891
Yoon Ha Ru!

796
53:46.862 --> 53:49.142
[One Meal with Ha Ru: Chef's Kitchen]

797
53:50.862 --> 53:53.999
And that's today's meal, complete.

798
53:53.999 --> 53:56.739
Today's guest, Yoon Ha Na...

799
54:20.318 --> 54:23.011
- Yoon Ha Na? - Yoon Ha Ru?

800
54:24.751 --> 54:26.131
[One Meal with Ha Ru]

801
54:28.598 --> 54:31.742
I'm in Ha Ru's body again?

802
54:31.742 --> 54:33.865
What is going on this time?

803
54:36.648 --> 54:38.019
[Ha Na! Taste reaction!] [Big smile, please]

804
54:40.731 --> 54:42.815
- What is it this time? - All right, then...

805
54:42.815 --> 54:45.381
What the hell is this?

806
54:46.684 --> 54:49.020
My little sister. Open wide.

807
54:49.020 --> 54:50.653
What?

808
54:59.850 --> 55:01.243
No.

809
55:16.838 --> 55:19.380
Wow, this is so good!

810
55:28.456 --> 55:29.726
This is amazing!

811
55:29.726 --> 55:31.087
Want some?

812
55:32.106 --> 55:33.769
Want some?

813
55:50.117 --> 55:51.875
What? Me?

814
55:51.875 --> 55:53.437
Huh?

815
55:53.437 --> 55:56.227
Not you. Ha Ru.

816
55:56.227 --> 55:59.247
You were just today's guest.

817
56:00.794 --> 56:06.708
So this is on my schedule every Thursday?

818
56:06.708 --> 56:08.767
You're so popular right now,

819
56:08.767 --> 56:13.024
advertisers are dying to get product placement on "One Meal with Ha Ru."

820
56:13.024 --> 56:15.022
That's why we're launching the spin-off,

821
56:15.022 --> 56:19.084
"One and Only Table," right away.

822
56:19.084 --> 56:20.684
"One and Only Table?"

823
56:20.684 --> 56:22.802
- What's that? - Sorry?

824
56:23.944 --> 56:25.468
Hey...

825
56:25.468 --> 56:27.421
Why are you looking at me like that?

826
56:27.421 --> 56:31.531
You're not having second thoughts, are you?

827
56:32.804 --> 56:34.300
No way.

828
56:34.300 --> 56:37.990
That's not like you.

829
56:37.990 --> 56:41.061
We already signed the contract.

830
56:44.760 --> 56:47.206
What happened this time?

831
56:55.282 --> 56:57.508
That's ours, right?

832
57:21.206 --> 57:24.172
This time, we're really back in the present.

833
57:25.680 --> 57:27.996
Yeah. It was that bastard Hyeong Won.

834
57:27.996 --> 57:30.316
The stalking, Woo Jae's death... all of it.

835
57:30.316 --> 57:32.815
Something was going on even back then.

836
57:35.545 --> 57:36.861
But something's off.

837
57:36.861 --> 57:39.773
Hyeong Won wasn't there to hurt me that day.

838
57:39.773 --> 57:41.246
What?

839
57:43.113 --> 57:45.205
What? Then...

840
57:47.585 --> 57:50.343
Anyway, what about Woo Jae?

841
57:50.343 --> 57:52.756
Oh, right. Jung Woo Jae.

842
57:56.078 --> 57:57.936
[My Boss]

843
58:10.947 --> 58:12.360
Ampoule From Myth.

844
58:12.360 --> 58:14.134
ValmoX5.

845
58:18.767 --> 58:20.129
Cut.

846
58:20.906 --> 58:22.201
Okay.

847
58:22.201 --> 58:24.448
- Okay. - Okay!

848
58:30.499 --> 58:32.545
Good work, everyone.

849
58:33.513 --> 58:35.157
Jung Woo Jae.

850
58:35.157 --> 58:36.437
Good work.

851
58:36.437 --> 58:38.915
Have I ever told you?

852
58:38.915 --> 58:42.336
You're optically blessed.

853
58:42.336 --> 58:45.103
Could there be a more perfect subject?

854
58:45.724 --> 58:47.968
I knew it from the start.

855
58:47.968 --> 58:50.068
I knew you'd make it big.

856
58:50.068 --> 58:51.225
I'm always grateful.

857
58:51.225 --> 58:53.585
See what I mean?

858
58:53.585 --> 58:55.071
Even after becoming a global superstar,

859
58:55.071 --> 58:59.675
he still sends me abalone, yellow corvina, and beef.

860
58:59.675 --> 59:01.699
- This guy's a blessing. - We're so lucky.

861
59:01.699 --> 59:03.559
Looks, talent, personality...

862
59:03.559 --> 59:07.843
Getting to work with someone this perfect shouldn't even be possible.

863
59:07.843 --> 59:10.466
I'm so glad I became his fan.

864
59:10.466 --> 59:12.697
Could there be bigger fangirl success than this?

865
59:12.697 --> 59:14.906
- Did you hear? - What?

866
59:14.906 --> 59:18.607
Woo Jae might be going to Cannes.

867
59:18.607 --> 59:20.377
It's still off the record.

868
59:20.377 --> 59:23.061
I knew this day would come!

869
59:23.715 --> 59:25.856
- Good job. - Good work.

870
59:25.856 --> 59:26.697
Thanks.

871
59:26.697 --> 59:28.786
Hee Joo, Da Eun. Great work today.

872
59:28.786 --> 59:29.989
You heading back to the office?

873
59:29.989 --> 59:31.256
- Yes. - Yes.

874
59:31.256 --> 59:34.101
- Let's drop them off first. - Got it.

875
59:34.791 --> 59:36.814
So... let's go.

876
59:52.342 --> 59:55.605
Wow. Guess he's a top star now.

877
59:55.605 --> 59:56.868
Yeah.

878
59:56.868 --> 59:59.970
He must've worked really hard.

879
01:00:00.770 --> 01:00:01.788
Hey!

880
01:00:01.788 --> 01:00:04.014
Wow, am I really that popular?

881
01:00:16.388 --> 01:00:18.893
Hey! Woo Jae looks amazing.

882
01:00:18.893 --> 01:00:20.725
- Right? - Yeah...

883
01:00:20.725 --> 01:00:22.414
Let's go.

884
01:00:25.041 --> 01:00:27.138
Look, just amazing.

885
01:00:27.138 --> 01:00:28.947
Are you that satisfied with it?

886
01:00:29.766 --> 01:00:31.337
You're here.

887
01:00:31.337 --> 01:00:33.933
Boss!

888
01:00:33.933 --> 01:00:37.027
What's with you? We talked on the phone yesterday.

889
01:00:45.450 --> 01:00:47.450
- Woo Jae! - Woo Jae!

890
01:00:49.296 --> 01:00:55.004
Oh, I thought you'd go straight there after you finished.

891
01:00:56.508 --> 01:00:59.144
I had to drop off some of the crew first.

892
01:00:59.144 --> 01:01:00.782
Woo Jae.

893
01:01:01.723 --> 01:01:03.988
Wow, Jung Woo Jae!

894
01:01:03.988 --> 01:01:05.486
Oh, my god...

895
01:01:05.486 --> 01:01:07.037
Look at you!

896
01:01:07.037 --> 01:01:10.267
Wow, you look amazing!

897
01:01:15.041 --> 01:01:16.888
What?

898
01:01:16.888 --> 01:01:18.795
Why?

899
01:01:28.309 --> 01:01:30.702
We're not that close, are we?

900
01:01:31.828 --> 01:01:34.749
Don't touch me.

901
01:02:19.472 --> 01:02:23.302
What did I do to Woo Jae?

902
01:02:23.302 --> 01:02:24.922
But in ten years...

903
01:02:24.922 --> 01:02:28.288
shouldn't things be better?

904
01:02:29.238 --> 01:02:32.236
Looks like things changed.

905
01:02:32.236 --> 01:02:34.484
A standout supporting actress?

906
01:02:34.484 --> 01:02:37.067
You're not going home tonight, Babe.

907
01:02:37.067 --> 01:02:38.835
"Lost Time?"

908
01:02:38.835 --> 01:02:40.678
It's a new script.

909
01:02:40.678 --> 01:02:42.671
An old camcorder...

910
01:02:42.671 --> 01:02:43.738
Time travel?

911
01:02:43.738 --> 01:02:46.718
Someone who knows the secret of our camcorder.

912
01:02:46.718 --> 01:02:50.297
And... tried to hide it.
